"No Czech wage-surcharge rates are configured for %(date)s. Add the record "
"under Employees ▸ Configuration ▸ Czech Wage Surcharges."
msgstr ""
"Pre %(date)s nie sú nastavené žiadne sadzby českých mzdových príplatkov. "
"Pridajte záznam v ponuke Zamestnanci ▸ Konfigurácia ▸ České mzdové "
"príplatky."

#. module: l10n_cz_hr_payroll_surcharges
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_hr_payroll_surcharges.field_hr_employee__l10n_cz_difficult_factors
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cz_hr_payroll_surcharges.field_hr_version__l10n_cz_difficult_factors
msgid ""
"Number of aggravating influences under § 2 odst. 2 nařízení vlády č. "
"443/2024 Sb. (until 31 December 2024: č. 567/2006 Sb.). Each earns a further"
" 10 % of the hourly minimum wage (§ 117). Zero means the surcharge does not "
"apply — recording hours alone will not pay it."
msgstr ""

